title=CanDualWield_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CanDualWield (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CanDualWield</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsAttack_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsAttack (spell flag)\">IsAttack</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Radiating_Orb\"> Condition: Radiating Orb </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiating_Orb_(Condition)\" title=\"Radiating Orb (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiating Orb\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Radiating_Orb_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Radiating_Orb_(Condition)\" title=\"Radiating Orb (Condition)\">Radiating Orb</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <b>-1</b> to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> per remaining turn. It also sheds bright light in an area surrounding it.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Reduce the duration by 2 each time the entity makes an attack.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fabricated_Arbalest\" title=\"Fabricated Arbalest\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fabricated_Arbalest\" title=\"Fabricated Arbalest\">Fabricated Arbalest</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The damage dealt is fixed to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> and does not benefit from most damage bonuses that would otherwise affect normal attacks.\n<ul><li>This includes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharpshooter:_All_In\" title=\"Sharpshooter: All In\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp/20px-Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp/30px-Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp/40px-Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharpshooter: All In\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp/20px-Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharpshooter:_All_In\" title=\"Sharpshooter: All In\">Sharpshooter: All In</a>, which applies the accuracy penalty <i>without</i> adding the damage bonus.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035318\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.102 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4038/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 60152/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22242/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.041/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1515481/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   87.995      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   87.995      1 -total\n 97.67%   85.947     58 Template:Trim\n 14.98%   13.186      2 Template:Item_icon\n 13.13%   11.553      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.99%   11.435      7 Template:Icon_text\n 10.58%    9.312      5 Template:Icon_link\n  7.51%    6.606      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  7.46%    6.561      1 Template:Condition\n  7.39%    6.499      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23949-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715035318 and revision id 373864. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}